# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. But do not ignore directories, otherwise Git won't look inside them
!*/

# 3. Explicitly allow the public web asset extensions everywhere
!*.html
!*.css
!*.js
!*.json
!*.pdf
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.svg
!*.webp

# 4. Explicitly allow essential repository files in the root
!.nojekyll
!.gitignore